---
---

<!-- ─── DEPLOYED TOOLS SECTION ─── -->
<section class="sec" id="tools" aria-label="Deployed Tools and Micro-Products - Kuldeep Sharma">
  <span id="services" class="sr-only" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  
  <div class="r">
    <div class="sec-label">Shipped Software · Production-Grade Web Utilities</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">
      Real Tools I Built & Deployed.<br>
      <span>(Try the fun tool I made!)</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">
      Fast, production web utilities built from scratch and shipped to production. 100% client-side execution, zero server uploads, and crafted for pure speed.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="tools-showcase-list">
    <!-- ─── TOOL 01: FreeCompressImage.com ─── -->
    <article class="tool-showcase-item r" aria-label="FreeCompressImage Showcase">
      <!-- Left Column: Clean & Clear Content -->
      <div class="tool-content-col">
        <div class="tool-chapter-tag">TOOL 01 · FOUNDER & BUILDER</div>
        <h3 class="tool-hero-title">FreeCompressImage</h3>
        <p class="tool-category-subtitle">Free in-browser image compressor and photo resizer</p>
        <div class="tool-timeline-tag">2024 to Present · 100% Client-Side</div>

        <p class="tool-narrative">
          Built to eliminate image bloat with zero privacy risk. Users compress JPG, PNG, and WebP files down to exact target KB ceilings (50KB, 100KB, 200KB) directly inside their browser using binary search quantization algorithms without uploading a single byte to any remote server.
        </p>

        <div class="tool-key-points">
          <div class="key-point-row">
            <span class="point-num">01</span>
            <p class="point-text">
              Engineered with client-side HTML5 Canvas and automated binary search quantization for instant execution.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="key-point-row">
            <span class="point-num">02</span>
            <p class="point-text">
              Zero server uploads: complete data privacy with all compression processing executing strictly on device.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="key-point-row">
            <span class="point-num">03</span>
            <p class="point-text">
              Target size ceilings: hit strict government, job application, or ecommerce portal upload byte limits in seconds.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Big Stat Counters Matching Reference -->
        <div class="tool-stats-row">
          <div class="t-stat-block">
            <div class="t-stat-val val-orange">&lt;50KB</div>
            <div class="t-stat-desc">exact target compression ceiling</div>
          </div>
          <div class="t-stat-block">
            <div class="t-stat-val val-white">100%</div>
            <div class="t-stat-desc">in-browser privacy (zero file uploads)</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tool-cta-wrap">
          <a 
            href="https://freecompressimage.com/" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="btn-p"
          >
            Try FreeCompressImage ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Clean Product Mockup / Visual Card -->
      <div class="tool-visual-col">
        <a 
          href="https://freecompressimage.com/" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="tool-window-card"
          aria-label="Launch FreeCompressImage live preview"
        >
          <div class="tool-window-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="tool-window-topbar">
            <div class="window-dots">
              <span class="w-dot dot-red"></span>
              <span class="w-dot dot-yellow"></span>
              <span class="w-dot dot-green"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="window-url-pill">
              <span class="url-lock">🔒</span> freecompressimage.com
            </div>
            <div class="window-live-badge">
              <span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="tool-window-body">
            <img 
              src="/images/tools/freecompressimage-screenshot.png" 
              alt="FreeCompressImage.com Web Application Interface" 
              width="1280" 
              height="800" 
              loading="lazy" 
              decoding="async" 
            />
            <div class="tool-hover-overlay">
              <span class="tool-overlay-btn">Open Live Web App ↗</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="tool-separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ─── TOOL 02: PDFToolsAi.com ─── -->
    <article class="tool-showcase-item r" aria-label="PDF Tools AI Showcase">
      <!-- Left Column: Clean & Clear Content -->
      <div class="tool-content-col">
        <div class="tool-chapter-tag">TOOL 02 · FOUNDER & BUILDER</div>
        <h3 class="tool-hero-title">PDF Tools AI</h3>
        <p class="tool-category-subtitle">All-in-one private in-browser WebAssembly PDF workstation</p>
        <div class="tool-timeline-tag">2024 to Present · Client-Side Wasm</div>

        <p class="tool-narrative">
          A comprehensive browser-based PDF suite designed for users who need full document utility without sacrificing security. Powered by client-side WebAssembly, it compresses documents to exact KB limits, converts, merges, splits, and auto-crops ecommerce shipping labels with zero file uploads.
        </p>

        <div class="tool-key-points">
          <div class="key-point-row">
            <span class="point-num">01</span>
            <p class="point-text">
              Client-Side WebAssembly (Wasm) architecture executing ISO-standard PDF processing entirely locally.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="key-point-row">
            <span class="point-num">02</span>
            <p class="point-text">
              Smart label croppers engineered specifically for Meesho and Flipkart ecommerce shipping workflows.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="key-point-row">
            <span class="point-num">03</span>
            <p class="point-text">
              Comprehensive suite: exact compression, format conversion (Word, Excel, JPG), merge, split, and encryption.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Big Stat Counters Matching Reference -->
        <div class="tool-stats-row">
          <div class="t-stat-block">
            <div class="t-stat-val val-orange">Exact KB</div>
            <div class="t-stat-desc">lossless stream document optimization</div>
          </div>
          <div class="t-stat-block">
            <div class="t-stat-val val-white">50+ Tools</div>
            <div class="t-stat-desc">all executing locally on your device</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tool-cta-wrap">
          <a 
            href="https://pdftoolsai.com/" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="btn-p"
          >
            Try PDF Tools AI ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Clean Product Mockup / Visual Card -->
      <div class="tool-visual-col">
        <a 
          href="https://pdftoolsai.com/" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="tool-window-card"
          aria-label="Launch PDF Tools AI live preview"
        >
          <div class="tool-window-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="tool-window-topbar">
            <div class="window-dots">
              <span class="w-dot dot-red"></span>
              <span class="w-dot dot-yellow"></span>
              <span class="w-dot dot-green"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="window-url-pill">
              <span class="url-lock">🔒</span> pdftoolsai.com
            </div>
            <div class="window-live-badge">
              <span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="tool-window-body">
            <img 
              src="/images/tools/pdftoolsai-screenshot.png" 
              alt="PDFToolsAi.com Web Application Interface" 
              width="1280" 
              height="800" 
              loading="lazy" 
              decoding="async" 
            />
            <div class="tool-hover-overlay">
              <span class="tool-overlay-btn">Open Live Web App ↗</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tools-showcase-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4.5rem;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .tool-showcase-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tool-separator {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), transparent);
  }

  /* Left Column */
  .tool-content-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .tool-chapter-tag {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tool-hero-title {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.8vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .tool-category-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .tool-timeline-tag {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #64748b;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .tool-narrative {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  /* Numbered Points */
  .tool-key-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding-top: 1.4rem;
  }

  .key-point-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .point-num {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace, sans-serif;
    color: var(--orange);
    font-weight: 800;
    padding-top: 0.15rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .point-text {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Stat Blocks */
  .tool-stats-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .t-stat-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .t-stat-val {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.7rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .val-orange {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .val-white {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .t-stat-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    max-width: 170px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tool-cta-wrap {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Right Column: Window Card Mockup */
  .tool-visual-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tool-window-card {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: #0b0d13;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.28);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), 0 0 40px rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.12);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tool-window-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 32px 75px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75), 0 0 50px rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.25);
  }

  .tool-window-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50px;
    right: -50px;
    width: 250px;
    height: 250px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.2), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tool-window-topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
    background: #11141c;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .window-dots {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .w-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .dot-red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .dot-yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .dot-green { background: #27c93f; }

  .window-url-pill {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace, sans-serif;
    color: #94a3b8;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .url-lock {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .window-live-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4ade80;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .live-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22c55e;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px #22c55e;
  }

  .tool-window-body {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }

  .tool-window-body img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .tool-window-card:hover .tool-window-body img {
    transform: scale(1.025);
  }

  .tool-hover-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(7, 8, 10, 0.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tool-window-card:hover .tool-hover-overlay {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .tool-overlay-btn {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #07080a;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(6px);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tool-window-card:hover .tool-overlay-btn {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* Responsive Rules */
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .tool-showcase-item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .tools-showcase-list {
      gap: 3.5rem;
    }

    .tool-stats-row {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
